A tender process and auction has been put in place for the allocation of capacity on the French/UK interconnector; France-Spain border auction planned for Autumn 2002; pro-rata allocation procedure has been put in place for French-Italian interconnector – priority for LT contracts. All other borders, first come first served procedure


